cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CZ Silicon Melt CFD Reference Dataset - Hot Wall Temperature Sweep"
abstract: >
  CFD reference dataset for Czochralski (CZ) silicon melt growth, covering
  hot wall temperature from 1730 to 1785 K across 10 steady cases. All cases
  use the same anchor point (crystal 8 rpm, crucible -3 rpm, hot wall 1745 K)
  and were checked for convergence, mesh independence, conservation, and
  physical consistency. The data was generated as reference input for a PINN
  and surrogate model being developed under the Quasi / SIMD project.
  Simulated using ANSYS Fluent 2026 R1.
